findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) cabinet beneath coffee maker by register counter (coffee grounds/splash);
B) upright reach-in freezer used for chicken and French fries on cook line (bottom inside - ice/food debris);
C) cooler that is currently out of service (reach-in side across from register counter - debris);  and
D) inside cabinet below tea dispensers in dining area (moisture/mold).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.citation_text:
750.1220 - Floors were observed to be soiled in the following areas:
A) chicken walkin freezer (food/debris under shelving);
B) around condensate drain outside the walkin cooler door (mold/moisture);
C) along the wall under the fry hot holding unit (food/single service articles); 
D) along wall under equipment at drive thru (single service articles/debris);   and
E) floor inside cabinet under tea dispensers in dining area (mold).

Clean floors along walls/under equipment throughout the facility daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
